{"gold": "en", "kind": null, "sid": "h-italic-060", "stratum": "italic", "text": "The principal things for the use of man, are Water, Fire, Iron, Salt, Meal, Wheat, Honey, Milk, Oil, Wine, Clothing, good to the godly, to the sinners turned to evil", "unit": "1.1.1.1"}
{"gold": "name", "kind": null, "sid": "h-italic-061", "stratum": "italic", "text": "Silvius", "unit": "2.3.5.1"}
